# headwear/helm/greathelm_crest: the great helm's crest (P2c ladder slice, LADDER-HEAD): the horsehair brush of
# headwear/helm/crested_crest on a steel holder seated on the great helm's flat crown (a row lower than on the crested dome),
# drawn only with a crest dial (crest1 small at T4 ... crest4; no dial, no crest: the plain T4 helm). Plume slot. Its own
# channel `crest`: rest; up (the bob lag: a row lower, a frame behind the head); breeze (the T5-T6 stir on the idle's
# breathe frame: the tail lifts a pixel; facing D / U the cap's light runs up a pixel). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role helm form3
role helm band3
layer headwear
anchor head
keys crest
z 2
tags overlay
legend Q plume 0
legend R plume 1
legend S plume 2
legend T plume 3
legend U plume 4

# (FORGE-HELM i2 plume_yield.py) the forge crest replaces the plume at T1-T4: empty views (begin)
view D key breeze when forge-homespun,!helm.t5,!helm.t6 replace
|.

